# ============================================================
#  Git Commit Message Template
#  Project: G1 Intellect - Humanoid Robot Intelligence Platform
#  Usage: Automatically loaded by Git during `git commit`
# ============================================================
#
# Format:
#   <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Example:
#   feat(lidar): add real-time dynamic filtering module
#
#   Implement robust point cloud filtering based on motion cues.
#
#   Closes #42
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Commit Types:
#   feat      - Add new feature or functionality
#   fix       - Fix a bug or correct behavior
#   docs      - Documentation or comments
#   style     - Code style or formatting changes (no logic impact)
#   refactor  - Restructure code without behavior change
#   perf      - Improve performance or efficiency
#   test      - Add or modify test scripts
#   build     - Build system or dependency updates
#   ci        - Continuous integration / deployment changes
#   chore     - Maintenance tasks, cleanup, minor updates
#   revert    - Revert previous commit
#   merge     - Merge branch integration
#   deps      - Dependency version updates
#   config    - Configuration or parameter changes
#   env       - Environment setup or install scripts
#   ui        - Visualization or interface changes
#   security  - Security or safety improvements
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Suggested Scopes:
#
#   Core Components:
#     perception     - Visual/sensor data processing and detection
#     control        - Motion control and actuation systems
#     navigation     - Path planning and obstacle avoidance
#     localization   - Robot positioning and state estimation
#     mapping        - Environment mapping and SLAM
#     planning       - Task and trajectory planning
#     safety         - Safety monitoring and emergency handling
#
#   System Infrastructure:
#     communication  - Inter-process/network communication
#     middleware     - System middleware and message passing
#     sensor         - Sensor drivers and hardware interfaces
#     actuator       - Motor control and hardware actuation
#     framework      - Core framework and architecture
#
#   AI & Algorithms:
#     ml             - Machine learning models and training
#     vision         - Computer vision algorithms
#     fusion         - Multi-sensor data fusion
#     dataset        - Dataset management and annotation
#
#   Simulation & Visualization:
#     simulation     - Simulation environments and testing
#     visualization  - UI, rendering, and data visualization
#     calibration    - Sensor and system calibration
#
#   Development Tools:
#     api            - Public API and interfaces
#     cli            - Command-line interface
#     sdk            - SDK integration and bindings
#     config         - Configuration management
#     test           - Testing infrastructure
#     benchmark      - Performance benchmarking
#
#   Build & Deployment:
#     deps           - Dependency management
#     build          - Build system and toolchain
#     ci             - Continuous integration/deployment
#     docker         - Container and deployment
#
#   Documentation:
#     docs           - Documentation and tutorials
#     examples       - Example code and demos
#     installation   - Setup and installation scripts
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Template:
<type>(<scope>): <subject>

# Description: explain what and why changes were made.
<body>

# Optional issue link for auto-closing.
Closes #<issue_number>

# End of commit message
# ============================================================
